      "A vintage black-and-white postcard showing the grand entrance of a neoclassical building partially obscured by trees and shrubbery. The building has three large arched windows with decorative pediments above, and a set of stairs with iron railings leads up to the front door. The top of the postcard features red printed text with the words 'Döbeln. Offizier-Kasino 139.'"
